Z||000009||sluppy123||04-02-2001||05:19 PM||||Need for Speed- I don't think the Fiero store sells any chin spoilers, I bought mine from <A HREF="http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/fiero_catalog.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1/fiero_catalog.htm</A>  for $250 U.S.<P><BR>The car is lowered with eibach sport springs, about a 1 3/4" drop up front. I would love to mold the chin onto the nose, but there's no way I could drive it, just to low to the ground(I can't ever get it out of the driveway wihout scraping) <BR>     I made some quick release fasteners so I can stick it on at car shows. I also think it looks a little "added on" painted black, so I'll have it painted to match the ground effects.<P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT-Leather, Lowered, Nitrous<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=7653930&p=37756786&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
